## Matching Agent - No Good Resume Left Behind

## The Problem

Recruiters handle multiple job openings and receive numerous resumes. Finding the right candidate for every role is challenging, especially when several positions have different requirements.

A candidate who doesn't match the current opening might be a perfect fit for another. But remembering and comparing every open role for every resume is difficult.

Good candidates get overlooked simply because recruiters can't remember every opportunity.

The Solution

Matching Agent is an AI-powered recruitment assistant that matches resumes against multiple available job openings to identify the best-fit roles.

Instead of asking:

"Is this candidate right for this job?"

It asks:

"Which of our available jobs is the best fit for this candidate?"

Key Features
Multi-Role Matching: Match one resume against multiple job openings.
Best-Fit Identification: Find the most relevant roles based on candidate experience and skills.
Smart Ranking: Rank job opportunities by their relevance to the candidate.
Alternative Role Discovery: Find suitable positions that recruiters might otherwise overlook.
Conversational Interface: Explore candidate-job matches through a simple chat-based experience.
Why Matching Agent?
Reduce missed candidate opportunities.
Save time spent on manual resume comparisons.
Discover talent across multiple job openings.
Improve candidate screening efficiency.
Make better use of the existing talent pool.
The Impact

A candidate might not be suitable for Job A but could be an excellent fit for Job B or Job C.

Matching Agent helps recruiters discover these connections without having to remember every job requirement.

It acts as an additional layer of intelligence in recruitment, helping humans make better-informed decisions.

